<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Teodoro de Croix</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1730">1730</a>–<a href="/years/1792">1792</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/18th-century">18th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Teodoro de Croix (1730–1792) was a Flemish-born officer in Spanish service who became the first commandant general of the Internal Provinces of northern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/viceroyalty-of-new-spain">New Spain</a> in 1776. He reorganised the frontier presidios and the defence against <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/apache">Apache</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/comanche">Comanche</a> raids. He was later Viceroy of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/peru">Peru</a> from 1784 to 1790.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/teodoro-de-croix.jpg" alt="Teodoro de Croix" width="320" height="470" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unidentified painter · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Teodoro_de_Croix.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote><b>Teodoro de Croix</b> became the first commandant general, with his seat at Arizpe in Sonora, later moved to Chihuahua.</blockquote><a href="/state/commandancy-general-of-the-internal-provinces">Commandancy General of the Internal Provinces</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lille">Lille</a>, in what is now <a href="/countries/france">France</a>. Died in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/madrid">Madrid</a>, in what is now <a href="/countries/spain">Spain</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=50.63,3.06&amp;year=1770" aria-label="Lille on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="4620 406 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Teodoro de Croix"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M5070 676h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M5070 676h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=50.63,3.06&amp;year=1770">What was here in 1770? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
